# First Kick V2 — no environment variables required to run the app.
# npm install && npm run dev is all you need.
#
# OPTIONAL: If you have a free football-data.org API key, add it below
# to enable live fixture data. Get one free at https://www.football-data.org/client/register
# Without it, the app uses the built-in static fixture dataset automatically.

# FOOTBALL_DATA_API_KEY=your_free_key_here
